.TH SEMOP 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
semop \- perform System V semaphore operations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/sem.h>
.B int semop(int id, struct sembuf* operations, size_t count);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Atomically performs count semaphore operations.  Each operation specifies a
semaphore number, signed adjustment, and flags including IPC_NOWAIT and
SEM_UNDO.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR semget (3crunch),
.BR semctl (3crunch),
.BR semop (2)
